# Durable suite-receipt store (eval/mppi_sandbox/receipt_store.py).
# MUST stay untracked: `worktree_fingerprint` covers tracked files only, so a
# committed store would change the tree on every archive and each receipt would
# invalidate itself the instant it landed — a cache that can never hit.
results/receipts/
